Package: bslibreact
Title: Bootstrap Layout for 'shinyreact' Apps
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Samuel", "Bharti", , "samuelbharti.io@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre", "cph"))
Description: A React component kit and R-side helpers for building Shiny
    apps in the shinyreact 'ui.tsx' pattern that look like 'bslib' apps.
    Provides page dependency discovery so a client bundle can request the
    same CSS and JavaScript a 'bslib' page would attach on its own, a
    hosted-input helper for widgets rendered server-side and displayed by
    the client, a live catalog of 'bslib' and 'shiny' markup for the
    matching JavaScript package's tests, and porting checks (triage, a
    dependency diff, and a headless-browser peek) for moving an existing
    'bslib' app to the ui.tsx pattern.
